Subject: [PATCH] modules: Delete a world's waypoints and explored map with it

Incari keeps them by the world's folder name, which a new world can take
again.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/world/level/storage/LevelStorageSource.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/world/level/storage/LevelStorageSource.java
index 261e6f5d75dd24b61eb26e2a42ca20f36f392946..a713677fe06068cc6e82e5039970e9fc869938e9 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/world/level/storage/LevelStorageSource.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/world/level/storage/LevelStorageSource.java
@@ -662,2 +662,5 @@
             }
+            // Incari start: the world's waypoints and explored map go with it
+            incari.client.modules.IncariModules.worldDeleted(this.levelId);
+            // Incari end
         }
